#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:1 e12a505c87544ba6acf262fb618d84ba
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:3 c6f3f308872f4cedb189d9d08929e31b
msgid "Every request must include an API key. Two equivalent options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:5 a01d23b6d31f4cb2afb5d2ae66f973c3
msgid "Authorization: Bearer rmh_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:9 4e305c76a65f4f2da31154bbd655da80
msgid "X-API-Key: rmh_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:13 84d169f55f7f42949dcbf9504429061b
msgid ""
"API keys authenticate as **your user account**. Writes are scoped to your"
" own account; you cannot act on behalf of others."
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:15 99ba9717dc7d4a29b1df5d1aa529d1ad
msgid "Key security"
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:17 ca334af8bd9b4787a6c1d2e445d140c4
msgid "Keys are random 256-bit secrets formatted `rmh_live_<base62>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:18 77e66086b00946718c324e2c394eb8ff
msgid ""
"The server stores **only a SHA-256 hash** — the plaintext is shown "
"**once** at creation and can never be retrieved again. The dashboard "
"shows a non-secret 4-character suffix so you can tell keys apart."
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:19 9b3f2c7592754040bfdc5fb377572339
msgid ""
"Treat a key like a password. Keep it server-side; never embed it in a "
"public client, repo, or browser bundle you don't control."
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:20 0b5c72946b6a42b79c051b9d4eb5075d
msgid ""
"**Scopes:** each key carries granular permissions — see "
"[Scopes](./scopes.md). Grant the least privilege a given integration "
"needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:21 83e71af87c8c45c7aab18842b57216ca
msgid ""
"**Expiry:** a key may be created with an expiry date; expired keys are "
"rejected exactly like revoked ones."
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:22 7d3ae1e8321d43da8a772c38019aed4a
msgid ""
"**Rotation:** rotate a key from "
"[`/developer`](https://rmhstudios.com/developer) to issue a new secret "
"while keeping the same key record — the old secret stops working "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:23 78395ac83f8f47889835b923146d7ff3
msgid ""
"**Revocation:** revoke a key any time from "
"[`/developer`](https://rmhstudios.com/developer); it takes effect at "
"once."
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:24 7ab7a291c56f499ab98def9e98293371
msgid ""
"If a subscription lapses or the account is suspended, all of that "
"account's keys stop working until the subscription is restored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:26 35a3b220b7ea49fc97780f676f932738
msgid "CORS and browser clients"
msgstr ""

#: ../../developer-api/authentication.md:29 9cacb0074db14c5bb04a7853c96d59e2
msgid ""
"Cross-origin requests are permitted, and authentication is by bearer key "
"rather than cookies — so the API is not a CSRF surface. That is *not* a "
"licence to ship a key in a public browser bundle: anything in client-side"
" JavaScript is readable by anyone who loads the page. Keep keys on a "
"server you control."
msgstr ""

